<!--
  SYS-736 not-found page. Served for CloudFront 404 responses.

  Everything is inline on purpose: when this page renders, mxtoolbox.com may be
  serving nothing, so a single external reference would leave the page bare. Do
  not add a stylesheet link, a font import, an <img src>, or a script tag.

  The navigation is a HAND-MAINTAINED STATIC COPY of the live top menu. On the
  real site that menu is rendered client-side by
  Public/templates/mx-top-menu/mx-top-menu.js (MxNew) against a jsRender
  template, pulling Bootstrap, Font Awesome and images.mxtoolbox.com -- none of
  which can be relied on here. The link list below is transcribed from
  GetPrimaryMenu() and GetSecondaryMenu_Supertool() in that file. When the real
  menu changes, this does not follow automatically; re-transcribe it.

  Dropdowns (the SUPERTOOL site picker, the Resources sub-menu) need JavaScript,
  so they are flattened to single links rather than faked.

  Deliberately light-only, unlike the maintenance page: this reproduces the
  site's own chrome, and a dark repaint of half the page would read as broken.

  Unlike the other pages here, a 404 means the site is HEALTHY and one URL is
  missing, so the navigation above is the whole point -- it is the visitor's way
  out. Derived from ServerError.html; keep the chrome in step.
-->
